&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a Senior Editor do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;WPP Production is seeking an experienced Senior Editor to join our London team within our&amp;nbsp;full-service post facility at GPS. As a Senior Editor, you&#39;ll be at the forefront of transforming&amp;nbsp;ideas into captivating visual narratives. Collaborating closely across multi-disciplinary studio&amp;nbsp;capabilities and in partnership with our talented Agency network, you&#39;ll refine and enhance&amp;nbsp;creative concepts to create beautiful and effective work that resonates with audiences globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Your creativity, craft, and expertise will shape campaigns for renowned brands, pushing&amp;nbsp;creative boundaries and delivering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Editing various projects including crafting original content and partnering with clients and&amp;nbsp;creatives to elevate the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Must be adept at working closely with creative teams, such as directors and other creative&amp;nbsp;professionals, to bring their vision to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Skilled at building strong relationships with creatives and clients to foster a productive and&amp;nbsp;collaborative working environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Proactive in bringing their own ideas, thoughts, and suggestions to the editing process,&amp;nbsp;adding value to the project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Developing efficient workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Collaborating with producers on scheduling needs and understanding the timelines on&amp;nbsp;projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Full comprehension and able to guide the team where needed workflows for audio, colour,&amp;nbsp;flame, and After FX sessions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Understanding of new AI tools and always bringing innovative ways of telling a story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;span class=&quot;s6&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Excellent working knowledge of Adobe Premiere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Working knowledge of After FX, Adobe Photoshop and Illustrator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Ability to maintain a positive, friendly relationship with all clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Curious and currently experimenting with latest AI tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Ability to work in fast-paced environment with tight deadlines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Must have commercial work and an extensive portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Meticulously organized and a team player.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Flexible and adaptable.&lt;/p&gt;
