&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in either Python, Go, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing extensive, multi-region service platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Kubernetes and background in managing cloud infrastructure, especially AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with container schedulers and runtimes such as Docker, Rkt, or OCI running on Kubernetes, Rancher, or Mesos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building deployment pipelines using common CI/CD tools&lt;/li&gt;
